Band Visual & Press Photoshoot Prompt: A futuristic tropical botanical garden, bathed in an unreal, golden-hour glow filtering through giant bioluminescent flora. The Lumina Swarm stand amidst colossal, slowly rotating clockwork flowers, their Chronosilk costumes shimmering with iridescent greens, pinks, and golds. Asteria is mid-swoop, her intricate, gear-adorned hanbok flowing, one hand touching a glowing Lumina Orb, her expression serene but intense. Rotor is caught in a blur of motion over his metallic tumbadoras, intricate clockwork mechanisms strapped to his forearms gleaming. Kaleido raises his glowing Aethel-Flute, its smooth meteorite surface reflecting the exotic light, while Chromium conjures swirling energy from her Geode-Synth, the crystals in its keys pulsating with an inner, soft light. Tropical humidity hangs in the air, refracting the light into a vibrant, dreamlike spectacle.

Descriptive Mood/Vibe: Exhilaratingly complex, impossibly joyful, crystalline, hyper-kinetic, shimmering.

